{"id":"2039975288232316929","title":"Biogas Plant V2","titleZh":"沼气发电厂（版本二）","channel":"listening","album":"D家听力全年高频","parts":[{"partNum":"Part 3","label":"Part 3","title":null,"subtitle":null,"audioUrl":"https://static.9fnnn.com/practice/part/2039975150227132418/part-exam-audio/2080693018247286856.mp3","article":"","groups":[{"id":"2039974572189126658","type":"map","contentHtml":"","options":[],"questions":[{"qNumber":"21","type":"map","rightAnswer":null,"options":[{"displayOrder":1,"id":"2039971705030021121","option":null,"optionContent":null,"optionNum":"A","questionId":"2039971481960157185"},{"displayOrder":2,"id":"2039971705034215426","option":null,"optionContent":null,"optionNum":"B","questionId":"2039971481960157185"},{"displayOrder":3,"id":"2039971705034215427","option":null,"optionContent":null,"optionNum":"C","questionId":"2039971481960157185"},{"displayOrder":4,"id":"2039971705034215428","option":null,"optionContent":null,"optionNum":"D","questionId":"2039971481960157185"},{"displayOrder":5,"id":"2039971705034215429","option":null,"optionContent":null,"optionNum":"E","questionId":"2039971481960157185"},{"displayOrder":6,"id":"2039971705034215430","option":null,"optionContent":null,"optionNum":"F","questionId":"2039971481960157185"},{"displayOrder":7,"id":"2039971705034215431","option":null,"optionContent":null,"optionNum":"G","questionId":"2039971481960157185"}],"sentenceIndex":"20-21","question":"Waste container","analyses":[{"labelsOne":"解析","labelsTwo":"","content":"录音明确指出左边较小的容器（smaller container on the left）是用来放收集来的废物的，对应图中的C。"},{"labelsOne":"句子","labelsTwo":"","content":"Yes. The smaller container on the left is where you put the waste you've collected."},{"labelsOne":"","labelsTwo":"干扰","content":"你可能会因为没重点听方位词“on the left”，而在图左侧的几个箭头和部件中犹豫不决。"}]},{"qNumber":"22","type":"map","rightAnswer":null,"options":[],"sentenceIndex":"24-25","question":"Slurry","analyses":[{"labelsOne":"句子","labelsTwo":"","content":"That's right. And that slurry on the base of the larger tank."},{"labelsOne":"","labelsTwo":"干扰","content":"听到“larger tank”时你可能会直接想选代表整个大水箱的D，但关键定位词其实是表示具体位置的“base（底部）”。"},{"labelsOne":"解析","labelsTwo":"","content":"录音提到在这个较大水箱的底部（base of the larger tank）有泥浆（slurry），对应图中大水箱最底部的G。"}]},{"qNumber":"23","type":"map","rightAnswer":null,"options":[],"sentenceIndex":"29","question":"Water inlet","analyses":[{"labelsOne":"句子","labelsTwo":"","content":"So is that pipe at the bottom where the water comes in?"},{"labelsOne":"","labelsTwo":"干扰","content":"你可能没反应过来“water comes in（进水）”就是题目中“inlet（入口）”的直接同义替换。"},{"labelsOne":"解析","labelsTwo":"","content":"男生提问证实了底部的那个管子就是水进来的地方（pipe at the bottom where the water comes in），对应图中底部代表水入口的A。"}]},{"qNumber":"24","type":"map","rightAnswer":null,"options":[],"sentenceIndex":"30-31","question":"Gas","analyses":[{"labelsOne":"句子","labelsTwo":"","content":"Yes, it is. As the slurry mixture digests, it produces gas, and that rises to the top of the dome."},{"labelsOne":"","labelsTwo":"干扰","content":"由于前两题都在看水箱底部，你可能会被惯性思维困住，忽略了动词“rises（上升）”指引你立刻把视线转移到图的顶端。"},{"labelsOne":"解析","labelsTwo":"","content":"录音提到消化过程会产生气体（gas），并且气体会上升到圆顶的顶部（rises to the top of the dome），对应图中最上方的E。"}]},{"qNumber":"25","type":"map","rightAnswer":null,"options":[],"sentenceIndex":"34-36","question":"Overflow tank","analyses":[{"labelsOne":"句子","labelsTwo":"","content":"I suppose there's some kind of safety valve to prevent pressure buildup. That's the overflow tank, that container on the right."},{"labelsOne":"","labelsTwo":"干扰","content":"你可能会被男生提问时抛出的“safety valve（安全阀）”干扰，跑去图里乱找，其实只要稳住听女生紧接着给出的方位词“on the right”就能锁定答案。"},{"labelsOne":"解析","labelsTwo":"","content":"男生猜测有安全阀，女生直接纠正说那是溢流罐（overflow tank），就是右边的那个容器（container on the right），对应图中的F。"}]}]},{"id":"2039974863034748929","type":"matching","contentHtml":"<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: auto table-layout: fixed; margin-top: 20px; line-height: 2.2; text-align: left;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 6px;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: bold;\">Lesson Outline Year Three</div>\n      <div style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: bold;\">Topic: Energy Activities</div>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #cfcfcf;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: center;\">Teacher: Introduce word</div>\n      <div style=\"text-align: center;\">Pupils: look and listen</div>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 2px; line-height: 1;\"> </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #cfcfcf;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: center;\">Teacher: <input placeholder=\"26\"></div>\n      <div style=\"text-align: center;\">Pupils: look and listen</div>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 2px; line-height: 1;\"> </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #cfcfcf;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: center;\">Teacher: present question</div>\n      <div style=\"text-align: center;\">Pupils: respond</div>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 2px; line-height: 1;\"> </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #cfcfcf;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: center;\">Teacher: <input placeholder=\"27\"></div>\n      <div style=\"text-align: center;\">Pupils: <input placeholder=\"28\"> and expand</div>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 2px; line-height: 1;\"> </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #cfcfcf;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: center;\">Teacher: display pictures</div>\n      <div style=\"text-align: center;\">Pupils: <input placeholder=\"29\"></div>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 2px; line-height: 1;\"> </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #cfcfcf;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: center;\">Teacher: <input placeholder=\"30\"></div>\n      <div style=\"text-align: center;\">Pupils: write</div>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 2px; line-height: 1;\"> </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #cfcfcf;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: center;\">Teacher: monitor pupils</div>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>","options":[{"displayOrder":1,"id":"2039974171255607297","option":"Identify sequence.","optionContent":"Identify sequence.","optionNum":"A","questionId":"2039972861672263681"},{"displayOrder":2,"id":"2039974171259801601","option":"Ask questions.","optionContent":"Ask questions.","optionNum":"B","questionId":"2039972861672263681"},{"displayOrder":3,"id":"2039974171259801602","option":"Copy.","optionContent":"Copy.","optionNum":"C","questionId":"2039972861672263681"},{"displayOrder":4,"id":"2039974171259801603","option":"Demonstrate meaning.","optionContent":"Demonstrate meaning.","optionNum":"D","questionId":"2039972861672263681"},{"displayOrder":5,"id":"2039974171259801604","option":"Distribute worksheet.","optionContent":"Distribute worksheet.","optionNum":"E","questionId":"2039972861672263681"},{"displayOrder":6,"id":"2039974171259801605","option":"Draw pictures.","optionContent":"Draw pictures.","optionNum":"F","questionId":"2039972861672263681"},{"displayOrder":7,"id":"2039974171259801606","option":"Present sentences.","optionContent":"Present sentences.","optionNum":"G","questionId":"2039972861672263681"}],"questions":[{"qNumber":"26","type":"matching","rightAnswer":null,"options":[{"displayOrder":1,"id":"2039974171255607297","option":"Identify sequence.","optionContent":"Identify sequence.","optionNum":"A","questionId":"2039972861672263681"},{"displayOrder":2,"id":"2039974171259801601","option":"Ask questions.","optionContent":"Ask questions.","optionNum":"B","questionId":"2039972861672263681"},{"displayOrder":3,"id":"2039974171259801602","option":"Copy.","optionContent":"Copy.","optionNum":"C","questionId":"2039972861672263681"},{"displayOrder":4,"id":"2039974171259801603","option":"Demonstrate meaning.","optionContent":"Demonstrate meaning.","optionNum":"D","questionId":"2039972861672263681"},{"displayOrder":5,"id":"2039974171259801604","option":"Distribute worksheet.","optionContent":"Distribute worksheet.","optionNum":"E","questionId":"2039972861672263681"},{"displayOrder":6,"id":"2039974171259801605","option":"Draw pictures.","optionContent":"Draw pictures.","optionNum":"F","questionId":"2039972861672263681"},{"displayOrder":7,"id":"2039974171259801606","option":"Present sentences.","optionContent":"Present sentences.","optionNum":"G","questionId":"2039972861672263681"}],"sentenceIndex":"47-48","question":"","analyses":[{"labelsOne":"解析","labelsTwo":"","content":"录音提到老师写完单词后，会做一些模仿动作（mime）来传达意思（convey the sense），完美对应选项D的“展示含义（Demonstrate meaning）”。"},{"labelsOne":"句子","labelsTwo":"","content":"I thought I'd introduce the topic by writing the word energy on the board and reinforcing the spelling and the pronunciation. Then I'll do a little mime, you know, run on the spot or something to convey the sense."},{"labelsOne":"","labelsTwo":"干扰","content":"你可能会把录音举例的“run on the spot（原地跑步）”当成一项单纯的体育活动，而没理解这只是为了“convey the sense（表达意思）”。"}]},{"qNumber":"27","type":"matching","rightAnswer":null,"options":[],"sentenceIndex":"55-56","question":"","analyses":[{"labelsOne":"句子","labelsTwo":"","content":"Yes, that's what I was going to do. Then I've produced a set of simple statements like, energy makes cars move along the road, and energy makes our bodies grow."},{"labelsOne":"","labelsTwo":"干扰","content":"这里的教学步骤比较长，你可能会把前面提到的写出问题（write the question）误当成这一步的答案而选错。"},{"labelsOne":"解析","labelsTwo":"","content":"录音顺着教学流程说到，老师接下来准备了一组简单的陈述句（a set of simple statements），对应选项G的“展示句子（Present sentences）”。"}]},{"qNumber":"28","type":"matching","rightAnswer":null,"options":[],"sentenceIndex":"58-61","question":"","analyses":[{"labelsOne":"句子","labelsTwo":"","content":"Are you going to give them out as a handout or write them up on the board? First, put them up on the board, and then I'll read them out loud, and I'll get the pupils to copy them out in their notebooks. I'll also ask them to think up one more similar statement by themselves and add it to the list."},{"labelsOne":"","labelsTwo":"干扰","content":"你可能会听到老师要“read them out loud（大声读出来）”就去选项里找听或读的动作，而漏听了紧接着针对学生的指令是“copy（抄写）”。"},{"labelsOne":"解析","labelsTwo":"","content":"老师说明会把句子写在黑板上，然后让学生抄写到他们的笔记本上（copy them out in their notebooks），动作要求直接对应选项C。"}]},{"qNumber":"29","type":"matching","rightAnswer":null,"options":[],"sentenceIndex":"63-64","question":"","analyses":[{"labelsOne":"句子","labelsTwo":"","content":"After that, I thought I'd vary things a bit by sticking some pictures up of things like the sun, and plants, and food, and petrol, and a running child. And I'll get the pupils to work out what order the pictures should come in in terms of the energy chain."},{"labelsOne":"","labelsTwo":"干扰","content":"录音里罗列了一大堆图片内容（太阳、植物、食物等），你可能会陷入这些名词细节里，而没抓住动词短语“work out what order”才是任务核心。"},{"labelsOne":"解析","labelsTwo":"","content":"贴出图片后，老师明确会让学生弄清楚这些图片应该以什么顺序出现（work out what order the pictures should come in），“order（顺序）”对应选项A的sequence。"}]},{"qNumber":"30","type":"matching","rightAnswer":null,"options":[],"sentenceIndex":"67-69","question":"","analyses":[{"labelsOne":"句子","labelsTwo":"","content":"Yes, I think they'd enjoy that. And to finish off, I've made a gap fill exercise to give out. They'll be doing that individually, and while they're writing, I'll walk around and check their work."},{"labelsOne":"","labelsTwo":"干扰","content":"你可能会因为没听懂“gap fill exercise（填空练习）”其实就是“worksheet（工作纸/练习卷）”的具体形式而不敢选E。"},{"labelsOne":"解析","labelsTwo":"","content":"录音提到最后老师做了一个填空练习来分发给学生（give out），“give out”是选项E“Distribute（分发）”的同义替换。"}]}]}]}]}